1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
And if anybody around you has called you a weirdo or spazzy or obnoxious or anything similar to that.
如果你身边有人叫你怪人、spazzy、讨厌鬼之类的，

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,681
Those people definitely don't matter they definitely don't deserve your energy.
那些人真的不重要，也不值得你消耗精力。

3
00:00:08,681 --> 00:00:13,360
And they're going to keep putting you down regardless of anything that you do about it I promise.
无论你怎么应对，他们都会继续贬低你，我保证。

4
00:00:13,360 --> 00:00:18,681
And by the way if those are the same words that you use to describe yourself try to speak more kindly towards yourself.
顺便说，如果你也用这些词形容自己，试着对自己说话更温柔些。

5
00:00:18,681 --> 00:00:22,360
Which I'm going to explain why in a bit and maybe put a positive spin on it.
我等会儿会解释原因；也可以换个积极角度来看。

6
00:00:22,360 --> 00:00:27,521
Like for example I may be loud but I'm also easy to talk to and people find me comforting.
比如：“我也许嗓门大，但我也很好聊，别人觉得和我相处很安心。”

7
00:00:27,521 --> 00:00:30,321
Or I may be high energy but I'm the life of the party.
或者：“我也许精力旺盛，但我也是聚会的开心果。”

8
00:00:30,321 --> 00:00:34,640
Or even I may be shy but I'm very observant and I'm very self aware.
甚至：“我也许害羞，但我观察细致，也很了解自己。”

9
00:00:34,640 --> 00:00:39,280
I think that when you finally find a confidence out of your own rebrand and being more comfortable with yourself.
我想，当你终于从自己的重塑过程中找到自信，和自己相处更自在，

10
00:00:39,280 --> 00:00:45,000
And also generally becoming a more positive and less serious person that's what really helped me level up.
并且总体上变得更积极、不那么严肃，这正是帮我提升自己的东西。

11
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:50,121
If you are comfortable with who you are people will definitely know this and appreciate that rebrand.
如果你接纳真实的自己，别人一定会看出来，也会欣赏这种改变。

12
00:00:50,121 --> 00:00:56,201
Okay let's start with my biggest and most important chapter and this is the key to become so secure in life and everything that you do.
好，开始我最大、最重要的一章。这是让你对生活和所做的一切都很有安全感的关键。

13
00:00:56,201 --> 00:01:01,561
You don't even need to rebrand so much as expanding your current brand it depends on who you want to become.
你甚至与其说需要重新塑造品牌，不如说是扩展现有品牌；这取决于你想成为谁。

14
00:01:01,561 --> 00:01:05,750
So you own the things you cannot change but always look to improve.
所以，承认那些你无法改变的东西，但始终寻找改进空间。

15
00:01:05,760 --> 00:01:12,271
It's like how apple sold computers and then they added smartphones and then tablets and watches and ai or whatever.
就像苹果最初卖电脑，后来增加智能手机、平板、手表、人工智能之类的东西。

16
00:01:12,281 --> 00:01:17,201
They don't need to change who they are completely just to sell new products they're still apple.
他们不必为了卖新产品就彻底改变自己；他们还是苹果。

17
00:01:17,201 --> 00:01:23,401
They use their same brand and design identity but then they also expand on it they're creating their own universe.
他们沿用相同的品牌和设计身份，同时又扩展它，创造自己的宇宙。

18
00:01:23,401 --> 00:01:29,841
So create a universe of you become your ideal version of yourself and think deeply about what that looks like.
所以，创造属于你的宇宙，成为理想中的自己，深入想想那会是什么样。

19
00:01:29,841 --> 00:01:35,201
And then visualize it to your best ability because your entire reality hinges on this.
然后尽你所能把它想象出来，因为她认为，你的整个现实都系于此。

20
00:01:35,201 --> 00:01:42,441
So ignore your current 3 d world for a second because this is the ideal world that you're going to be creating for yourself.
所以暂时忽略目前的三维世界，因为这是你将为自己创造的理想世界。

21
00:01:42,441 --> 00:01:48,880
Your interpretation of life is a projection of your self concept so make it a really good one.
你对生活的理解，是你自我概念的投射，所以让它成为一个很好的版本。

22
00:01:48,880 --> 00:01:57,590
And then forget about taking action for now we're going to save that for later focus on changing your beliefs first from the deepest parts of yourself.
先别管行动，我们留到后面再说。先从内心深处开始改变信念。

23
00:01:57,600 --> 00:02:08,241
People who are so concerned with taking action non stop they don't realize that your belief system is way bigger than taking action because it's how you see your entire life.
那些总想着不停行动的人没有意识到，你的信念体系比行动更大，因为它决定你如何看待整个人生。

24
00:02:08,241 --> 00:02:12,760
So once your beliefs change you're not going to feel like there's anything else to do.
所以，一旦信念改变，你就不会觉得还有别的事情要做，

25
00:02:12,760 --> 00:02:17,201
Because you see everything based off of the self concept that you've created.
因为你会基于自己建立的自我概念来看待一切。

26
00:02:17,201 --> 00:02:22,480
The keyword here is to be it will always go back to who you are being.
这里的关键词是“成为”；最终总会回到你正在成为怎样的人。

27
00:02:22,480 --> 00:02:27,160
Because at the end of the day every single thing is just the story that you've decided to live.
因为说到底，每一件事都是你决定活出的那个故事，

28
00:02:27,160 --> 00:02:35,040
And you are the source for that you are the author of your own biography so take this really seriously this is your life.
而你是故事的源头，是自己传记的作者。所以，认真对待这件事，这是你的人生。

29
00:02:35,040 --> 00:02:41,201
To be or not to be this will make it easier to dismiss any kind of lies that people say about you or gossip.
“生存还是毁灭。”这样会让你更容易不理会别人说你的谎言或闲话，

30
00:02:41,201 --> 00:02:47,841
When you understand that you're the only source and it's about forming your identity only you have the truth about yourself.
因为你明白，自己才是源头；这关乎形成自己的身份，只有你掌握自己的真相。

31
00:02:47,841 --> 00:02:52,641
You and your reality are just the result of what you have accepted as the truth.
你和你的现实，只是你接受为真相的那些事的结果。

32
00:02:52,641 --> 00:02:57,121
So once you set your beliefs into stone everything else is going to follow.
所以，一旦你把信念确立下来，其他一切都会随之而来。

33
00:02:57,121 --> 00:03:02,401
You don't wait for reality to happen reality is waiting for you to take the lead.
你不是等现实发生，而是现实在等你带头行动。

34
00:03:02,401 --> 00:03:06,760
So understand that your whole life is a projection of your self concept.
所以，要理解：你的整个人生都是自我概念的投射。

35
00:03:06,760 --> 00:03:10,561
It's the foundational beliefs that you interact with on a daily basis.
那是你每天都在与之互动的基础性信念。

36
00:03:10,561 --> 00:03:14,561
Meaning the way that you see the world and that becomes your entire life.
也就是你看世界的方式，而那会变成你的整个人生。

37
00:03:14,561 --> 00:03:22,241
When an aspect of your self concept changes your reality shifts and it shifts immediately because your views about everything is going to change.
当自我概念的一方面改变时，你的现实会改变，而且马上改变，因为你看一切的方式都会变。

38
00:03:22,241 --> 00:03:29,030
For example an insecure person interprets everything in an insecure way and that identity creates even more insecurity.
比如，一个不自信的人会用不自信的方式解释一切，而这种身份又会制造更多不安全感。

39
00:03:29,040 --> 00:03:35,201
And since this is how they view themselves the assumptions and thoughts that go along with it is going to also naturally happen.
因为他们这样看待自己，与之相伴的假设和想法也会自然出现。

40
00:03:35,201 --> 00:03:42,111
And because they are insecure they will say things that an insecure person will say and they will do things and an insecure person does.
又因为不自信，他们会说不自信的人会说的话、做不自信的人会做的事（字幕语法如此）。

41
00:03:42,121 --> 00:03:49,001
Like for example I don't believe that person deserves success I don't think I deserve to have that kind of relationship.
比如：“我不觉得那个人值得成功”“我不觉得自己配拥有那种关系”。

42
00:03:49,001 --> 00:03:57,870
They will constantly undermine themselves and also other people around them and that's just the end result of being an insecure person.
他们会不断削弱自己，也削弱周围的人；她说这就是缺乏自信的结果。

43
00:03:57,880 --> 00:04:02,281
If they change that part of themselves and stop getting in their own way constantly.
如果他们改变那一部分的自己，不再总是给自己设障碍，

44
00:04:02,281 --> 00:04:06,201
Then they are going to stop focusing on whether or not other people deserve success.
他们就不会再纠结别人是否值得成功，

45
00:04:06,201 --> 00:04:08,671
Or whether they think that they deserve the best relationship.
也不会纠结自己是否值得拥有最好的关系。

46
00:04:08,681 --> 00:04:12,521
And those are just examples but you see this everywhere with people that you know.
这些只是例子，但你在认识的人身上到处都能看到。

47
00:04:12,521 --> 00:04:18,121
Change your self concept and your views on everything will automatically shift.
改变你的自我概念，你对一切的看法就会自动转变。
